      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Replacement</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We swap aging tanks in Riverview basements and side yards for new CSA-approved models, usually in a single visit. Most jobs get booked within days, not weeks.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Removal</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Moving to a heat pump or electric baseboard? We drain, disconnect, and haul away the old tank, and leave you paperwork your insurer will accept.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Buried Oil Tank Removal</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Some older lots in Bridgedale and along Coverdale Road date back before Riverview amalgamated, and a few still hide underground tanks. We locate, excavate, and remove them properly.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Emergency Leaking Tank Service</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A leaking tank can't wait for Monday, especially in a Riverview January. Our 24/7 emergency line gets a crew over the bridge fast.</p>
